SUMMARY:From Balconies to Backyards: Planning a Successful Vegetable Garden
DESCRIPTION:Want to enjoy vegetables you’ve grown yourself in your own backyard or on your balcony? \nA Toronto Master Gardener will lead a demonstration and show how to get started to grow your own vegetables. Get some tips and learn techniques for successful growing. At the end of the program\, vegetable seeds or seedlings will be shared with attendees\, while supplies last. \nFree. Drop-in\, registration is not required.
